<p>Thank you for your interest in Zenith Prep Academy! We're excited to learn more about your student's college goals and explore how we can help them stand out.</p>

<p>The next step is a complimentary <strong>Initial Consultation</strong> with one of our Admission Counselors over Zoom. This 60-minute conversation is a chance for us to understand your student's academic profile, discuss the colleges they are targeting, and outline a personalized plan that fits your family's needs.</p>

<p>Please use the scheduling link below to choose a meeting time that works best for your family's schedule:</p>

